  "fullDescription": "Plan Your Perfect Day with Our Digital Wedding Planner\nOur Wedding Planner is the perfect tool to help you plan and organize your dream wedding. With sections for wedding Gifts, Vendor & Services, Guest, Pre-wedding events, Honeymoon, Ceremony & Reception, Hotel & Transportations, Venue Selection, and Wedding Attire, our wedding planner ensures you don’t miss a single detail.\nLet’s make your special day unforgettable!\n\n✔︎ Fully hyperlinked to make navigation buttery smooth\n✔︎ Daily, weekly, monthly Planning Pages\n✔︎ Monday and Sunday start\n✔︎ Index with quick access to each section\n✔︎ Portrait Mode\n✔︎ Boho, modern, chic & stylish design.\n✔︎ All pages can be easily duplicated and/or removed\n\nGIFTS\n✔︎ Gift Registry Checklist\n✔︎ Gift Registry Tracker\n✔︎ Wedding Registry Planner\n\nVENDORS & SERVICES\n✔︎ Vendor List\n✔︎ Cake Planner\n✔︎ Photo Checklist\n✔︎ Appetizers\n✔︎ Wedding Decor\n✔︎ Checklist\n✔︎ Videography Planner\n✔︎ Entertainment Planner\n✔︎ Music List\n✔︎ Song List\n\nGUESTS\n✔︎ Guest List\n✔︎ Seating Chart\n\nPRE-WEDDING EVENTS\n✔︎ Pre-wedding Party\n✔︎ Wedding Party Plan\n\nHONEYMOON\n✔︎ Honeymoon Packing List\n✔︎ Travel Planner\n✔︎ Travel Itinerary\n\nCEREMONY & RECEPTION\n✔︎ Wedding Reception Checklist\n✔︎ Order Planner\n✔︎ Rentals Checklist\n✔︎ Equipment Checklist\n✔︎ Reception Rentals Checklist\n✔︎ Rehearsal Dinner Planner\n✔︎ Rehearsal Guest List\n✔︎ Wedding Officiant Planner\n\nHOTEL & TRANSPORTATIONS\n✔︎ Hotel & Accomodation Planner\n\nVENUE SELECTION\n✔︎ Ceremony Venue Planner\n✔︎ Reception Venue Planner\n✔︎ Venue Comparison\n\nWEDDING ATTIRE\n✔︎ Attire Moodboard\n✔︎ Bride’s Attire Planner\n✔︎ The Perfect Dress\n✔︎ Bride’s Accessories\n✔︎ Checklist\n✔︎ Bride & Groom\n✔︎ Beauty Planner\n✔︎ Bridesmaids Attire Planner\n✔︎ Item Order Tracker\n✔︎ Measurement Reference Page\n\nCOMPATIBLE\nWorks with iPad and Android Tablets.\nSupported Annotation Apps: GoodNotes, Notability, and Xodo\nNote: All compatible apps or software may be chargeable.\n\nHOW TO DOWNLOAD IT?\nFiles are not emailed to you. For your convenience, they are available for download directly on Creativefabrica. On the My Profile, go to You > My Downloads > Click the button “Download Files”.\n\nDownloading and Unzipping from Creative Fabrica\nClick the green download button next to the file you want.\nThe file will download as a .zip file.\nRight-click the .zip file on your computer.\nSelect “Extract All” (Windows) or “Open With > Archive Utility” (Mac).\nChoose a folder and click “Extract” or “Unzip”.\n\nHOW TO USE IT?\n—Download your digital files on your device.\nImport to GoodNotes or any Annotation app\n\nIf you have any further questions, please do not hesitate to contact me.\nThank you for choosing us!",
